<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN"
  "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <!-- The Watcher's launchd agent. Installed by `./trace install`; checked
       in so launch week holds no surprises.

       CORRECTED 2026-07-29. This pointed at `-m tracemem.app.daemon`, which
       has NO main(): running it defines some classes and exits 0. Combined
       with KeepAlive.SuccessfulExit=false that is the worst possible
       failure — launchd loads the agent, the process "succeeds" instantly,
       launchd correctly declines to resurrect a clean exit, and TRACE looks
       installed while never watching anything. Nothing anywhere reports it.
       The real entrypoint is the `tracemem` module itself, and it needs the
       eye flag (explicit consent to capture) and the ask flag (the brain and
       the socket) or the daemon runs blind and mute. Those flags are spelled
       out in ProgramArguments below; they cannot be written in this comment,
       because a double hyphen is illegal inside XML comments (plutil accepts
       it, expat does not, and the suite reads it with expat).

       The absolute paths below are the founder's; `./trace install`
       REGENERATES this file for whatever machine it runs on rather than
       copying these. A checked-in path is documentation, not configuration.
       KeepAlive.SuccessfulExit=false: a CLEAN stop (exit 0, after the
       clean-stop witness) is respected — launchd resurrects crashes only.
       ThrottleInterval cooperates with the crash-loop brake (its own atom):
       launchd spaces restarts; the brake stops them entirely at 5/min. -->
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>com.trace.watcher</string>
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/Applications/TRACE.app/Contents/MacOS/TRACE</string>
    <string>--daemon</string>
  </array>
  <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
  <string>/path/to/trace</string>
  <key>RunAtLoad</key>
  <true/>
  <key>KeepAlive</key>
  <dict>
    <key>SuccessfulExit</key>
    <false/>
  </dict>
  <key>ThrottleInterval</key>
  <integer>10</integer>
  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>~/Library/Logs/TRACE/watcher.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>~/Library/Logs/TRACE/daemon.log</string>
  <key>ProcessType</key>
  <string>Background</string>
</dict>
</plist>
